# Vite env vars consumed by the dashboard. Copy to .env.local for local dev,
# or set in Cloudflare Pages "Environment variables" for the deployed build.
# All VITE_-prefixed vars are inlined into the client bundle at build time.

# Bearer token sent on every /api/... request. MUST match the DASHBOARD_TOKEN
# env var on the CF Pages project (server-side). Without it, the dashboard
# falls back to mock data for tasks and photos.
VITE_DASHBOARD_TOKEN=replace-with-the-same-string-as-server-DASHBOARD_TOKEN
